  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Bi Weng rates Immortal Crane Sect’s odds high because two Gu Immortals plus the blue charm lightning shadow face a mortal owner of Hu Immortal blessed land, she answers from Spirit Butterfly Valley’s investigation: Fang Yuan refined Fixed Immortal Travel in Three Kings blessed land and arrived alone, which a mortal should not manage, and a mastermind behind him may have the battle strength to resist Immortal Crane Sect.",
