      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above Central Continent, while Gu Immortals place Gu for the star array calculation formation, she transmits to Fairy Bai Qing and asks whether they can join the Heaven and Earth Great Love Alliance. She calls the twenty percent discount and free entry and exit a huge bargain, and says that if she were not from Spirit Butterfly Valley she would have joined already. Colorful butterflies fly around her as she places Gu worms at designated locations. She and Fairy Bai Qing later press He Feng Yang with the same question; he answers that he does not know either.",
      "chapters": [
